      "text": "Decoding (find #, read length, extract word):\n\n\" 5#hello 5#world\"\nFind #: get length 5 -> extract \"hello\"\nFind #: get length 5 -> extract \"world\"\n\nResult: [\"hello\", \"world\"]",
